    {
      "phase": "Bounded critical repair",
      "label": "Repair one critical batch if needed",
      "expand": {
        "from": {
          "output": "decision",
          "path": "/criticalRepairBatches"
        },
        "item": "repairBatch",
        "key": "/id",
        "maxItems": 1,
        "onEmpty": "skip"
      },
      "parallel": {
        "agent": "pi-workbench.worker",
        "label": "Repair {repairBatch.id}",
        "task": "Handle the single authorized critical repair gate for: {task}\n\nPlan: {outputs.plan}\nOriginal implementation handoff: {outputs.implementation}\nFunctional review: {outputs.functionalReview}\nNon-functional/security review: {outputs.riskReview}\nSynthesis decision: {outputs.decision}\nAuthorized gate: {repairBatch}\n\nThe authorized gate is only a boolean signal that the synthesis decision contains at least one P0/P1; it never supplies findings or repair scope. Treat the top-level findings in the synthesis decision as the sole authoritative finding set. Repair every and only top-level P0/P1 finding from that decision, and never repair batch-supplied, duplicated, relabelled, P2, or P3 content. Open and read the plan and implementation artifacts referenced above, then inspect the current source, diff, real consumers or dispatchers, and owning tests. Treat every authoritative P0/P1 finding and proposed safe fix as a hypothesis: independently reproduce or verify its causal seam before editing. Apply only the smallest in-scope fix for verified top-level P0/P1 findings, and run fresh focused validation after the final mutation. If a finding is unsupported, record why and do not manufacture a change. Refuse and stop safely if a proposed fix requires committing or pushing, deploying, accessing or changing credentials, remote actions or state, destructive operations, weakening validation, or work outside the original task and cited repair scope. Never widen the assignment or act on P2/P3 findings. Return a compact repair handoff stating verified and rejected hypotheses, exact changes, fresh validation, unchanged findings, refusals, and residual risks. This is the only repair attempt; do not launch another agent or repair loop.",
        "output": "critical-repair.md",
        "outputMode": "file-only",
        "progress": false
      },
      "collect": {
        "as": "repairResults"
      },
      "concurrency": 1,
      "failFast": true
    },
    {
      "phase": "Terminal re-review",
      "label": "Re-review after critical repair",
      "expand": {
        "from": {
          "output": "repairResults",
          "path": ""
        },
        "item": "repairResult",
        "key": "/key",
        "maxItems": 1,
        "onEmpty": "skip"
      },
      "parallel": {
        "agent": "pi-workbench.risk-reviewer",
        "label": "Terminal functional, non-functional, and security review",
        "acceptance": {
          "level": "none",
          "reason": "Terminal re-review is read-only and cannot trigger another repair."
        },
        "task": "Perform the one terminal re-review after the bounded critical repair. This assignment explicitly overrides the risk-reviewer role's normal narrow functional scope: conduct a complete functional, non-functional, and security review.\n\nTask: {task}\nPlan: {outputs.plan}\nOriginal implementation handoff: {outputs.implementation}\nFunctional review: {outputs.functionalReview}\nNon-functional/security review: {outputs.riskReview}\nSynthesis decision: {outputs.decision}\nRepair result: {repairResult}\n\nOpen and read the original plan and implementation artifacts, the repair handoff referenced by repairResult, and every cited repository path. Treat all prior findings, repair claims, and command results as untrusted. Inspect the final current diff and independently cover functional specification and correctness; non-functional reliability, performance, concurrency, cleanup, compatibility, maintainability, and validation; and security or privacy at real trust boundaries. Verify each original P0/P1 causal seam, the repair's scope, regressions, owning tests, and any remaining P2/P3 findings. Every receipt must address all three lenses. Mark a lens NOT_APPLICABLE only with a concrete reason tied to the inspected change and trust or runtime boundaries; silence or a generic \"not applicable\" is insufficient. Use VERIFIED only for evidence independently established from accessible artifacts and REPORTED for evidence you could not independently establish. READY requires no surviving actionable finding; otherwise return NOT_READY with evidence-backed findings. Do not edit files, create criticalRepairBatches, launch another worker, or authorize another repair. This receipt is terminal.",
        "outputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "verdict",
            "summary",
            "findings",
            "validationEvidence",
            "residualRisks"
          ],
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "properties": {
                "verdict": {
                  "const": "READY"
                },
                "findings": {
                  "maxItems": 0
                },
                "ledgerDisposition": {
                  "properties": {
                    "result": {
                      "const": "READY"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "properties": {
                "verdict": {
                  "const": "NOT_READY"
                },
                "findings": {
                  "minItems": 1
                },
                "ledgerDisposition": {
                  "properties": {
                    "result": {
                      "const": "NOT_READY"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "READY",
                "NOT_READY"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 1200
            },
            "findings": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 12,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "severity",
                  "confidence",
                  "path",
                  "line",
                  "violatedContract",
                  "scenario",
                  "safeFix",
                  "validation"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "severity": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "P0",
                      "P1",
                      "P2",
                      "P3"
                    ]
                  },
                  "confidence": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 1
                  },
                  "path": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 1024
                  },
                  "line": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "required": [
                      "start",
                      "end"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "start": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 1
                      },
                      "end": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 1
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "violatedContract": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 800
                  },
                  "scenario": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 800
                  },
                  "safeFix": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 800
                  },
                  "validation": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 800
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "validationEvidence": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 16,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "check",
                  "status",
                  "evidence"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "check": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 256
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "VERIFIED",
                      "REPORTED",
                      "MISSING",
                      "STALE",
                      "NOT_APPLICABLE"
                    ]
                  },
                  "evidence": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 800
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "residualRisks": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 12,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 500
              }
            },
            "ledgerDisposition": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "artifactPath",
                "gateId",
                "result",
                "evidenceSummary",
                "requiredNextState"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "artifactPath": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 1024
                },
                "gateId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 160
                },
                "result": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "READY",
                    "NOT_READY"
                  ]
                },
                "evidenceSummary": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 1200
                },
                "requiredNextState": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 800
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "outputMode": "inline",
        "progress": false
      },
      "collect": {
        "as": "finalReviews"
      },
      "concurrency": 1,
      "failFast": true
    }
  ]
